#==============================================================================================
#
#   idl_event_listener - DOM::IDLEventListener: an EventListener callback object
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/DOM/IDLEventListener.cpp (lines 1-32) and IDLEventListener.h
#       (lines 1-46). In C++ the listener is a JS::Object whose prototype is the realm's
#       %Object.prototype%; before phase 3 it is a cell holding its callback (DESIGN.md §3.6).
